    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n“Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.A truly superb, well located spacious four bedroom semi-detached residence situated in a quiet mature setting just off the Pearse road in Sligo city.The sizeable accommodation totals 112 sq.m. / 1206 sq.ft. approximately & comprises on the ground floor of a welcoming entrance hallway with understairs wc, large sitting room with feature open fireplace, bay window & double doors to the dining room, well equipped kitchen with extensive range of fitted units, separate formal dining room with sliding door to the rear garden & a handy utility room.Upstairs are four sizeable bedrooms (one with ensuite) a well-equipped house bathroom and a large landing area with hotpress.The extra-large rear garden has great privacy and a sunny south west facing aspect bordered by beautiful natural stone walls that predate the houses themselves. As the house is the first house in the line it has the benefit of a larger garden to the rear & side. It has a sunny private paved patio that links well with the kitchen / dining room.The front has off street paved car parking & overlooks a beautiful mature parkland green area also giving great privacy to the property. This instantly appealing home boasts an excellent location within walking distance to Sligo city centre.Viewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.7m x 1.7m\nunderstairs wc & whb, coving, side window\n\nUtility Room - 2.6m x 1.9m\nplumbing for washing machine, side window, gas boiler\n\nKitchen - 4.9m x 2.6m\nextensive range of fitted kitchen units, door to the rear garden, side window & rear window\n\nDining room - 4m x 2.8m\nsliding patio door out onto sunny rear patio & garden, double doors to sitting room\n\nSitting room - 5.9m x 3.6m\nfeature open fireplace, double doors to the dining room, bay window\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 3.5m x 2m\nside window, hotpress\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.6m x 3.1m\nbuilt in double wardrobe, lovely views overlooking the marture green area to the front\n\nEnsuite - 1.5m x 1.5m\nwc, whb, shower, wall & floor tiling\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 2.2m\nbuilt in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 2.7m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.7m x 2.3m\n\n\nHouse bathroom - 2.2m x 1.6m\nwc, whb, bath, wall tiling\n\n"
